# PLAN-939 S08 resource-recovery SKELETON (T-03 batch 2): the file
# registers the recovery case family and lands the flows the delivered
# machinery already proves green — fresh publish → pure hit → worker
# restart → FIRST semantics-preserving body edit on the RESTORED session
# (the resolver-owned lane re-resolves and republishes; exit re-pins the
# oracle) on a RECORD deck (the T-02A utf8 twin covered the text deck).
#
# T-09/T-10-owned expansions (V-06/08/09/10/16, AC-04/05/06):
#  - first-error → fix → re-restore: DELIVERED by T-09 as
#    `ace-ca-d3.recover-first-error-{native,c}` in resource-import.case.ad
#    (the reviewed fail deck opens at its failure, the edits switch the
#    seed AND the reviewed reference scenario in the same move, the fix
#    admits under the record-mut oracle with a per-step pe_exit override,
#    the reverse pair restores the reviewed failure) plus the worker-level
#    `abi_resource939_restore_first_edit_fails_publishes_nothing_then_fix_and_recover`
#    (a FAILED first edit after restore publishes nothing; the accepted
#    root survives byte-identical).
#  - precise reader invalidation counters: DELIVERED by T-09 as
#    `ace-ca-d3.increment-body-edit-{native,c}` (per-query compute pins)
#    plus the worker-level per-stage pins
#    (`abi_resource939_body_edit_reproduces_only_the_edited_function`:
#    fresh 2/2/2 → hit all-P0 → body edit exactly 1/1/1 → provider-only
#    transition 0 source stages + binding generation 2; declaration-side
#    mode/layout/clone/deleter axes are bound to the frozen reviewed
#    provider manifest v1 — their digest-keyed invalidation mechanism is
#    evidenced by the provider-generation axis, distinct per-axis cases
#    would need new reviewed manifests, named to T-11).
#  - required resource/contract/provider pages: DELIVERED by T-09 at the
#    worker level (missing/corrupt/forged-pointer axes all refuse —
#    never a silent cold start, never a forged decode; the accepted
#    pointer is never overwritten by a refusal).
#  - T-10 remains owner of: 512-revision GC convergence, budget caps on
#    the recovery lane, and the original 6×30 sample discipline.

# fresh → hit → restart → first good edit (commuted return, same 42) on
# the restored session — both legs native and c.
